"I updated the colab and my post above with the `tf.Module` that I used to generate the MLIR, and changed the outputs of the module so that they more clearly show what is supposed to be the 1st, 2nd  and 3rd outputs.","created_at":"2021-04-05T22:31:36Z","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/5320#issuecomment-813687641","id":813687641,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/5320","minimized":null,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgxMzY4NzY0MQ==","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/813687641/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-04-05T22:42:18Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/813687641","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40036383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phoenix-meadowlark","id":40036383,"login":"phoenix-meadowlark","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMDM2Mzgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"The general pattern is:\r\n\r\n```python\r\nreturn tuple()\r\nexpected = []\r\nactual   = None\r\n\r\nreturn (0,)\r\nexpected = [0]\r\nactual   = [None, 0]\r\n\r\nreturn 0, 1\r\nexpected = [0, 1]\r\nactual   = [None, 1]\r\n\r\nreturn 0, 1, 2\r\nexpected = [0, 1, 2]\r\nactual   = [None, 1, None, 2]\r\n\r\nreturn 0, 1, 2, 3\r\nexpected = [0, 1, 2, 3]\r\nactual   = [None, 1, None, 3]\r\n\r\nreturn 0, 1, 2, 3, 4\r\nexpected = [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]\r\nactual   = [None, 1, None, 3, None, 4]\r\n\r\nreturn 0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5\r\nexpected = [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\r\nactual   = [None, 1, None, 3, None, 5]\r\n```","created_at":"2021-04-06T17:29:08Z","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/5320#issuecomment-814299285","id":814299285,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/5320","minimized":null,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgxNDI5OTI4NQ==","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/814299285/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-04-06T17:29:08Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/814299285","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40036383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phoenix-meadowlark","id":40036383,"login":"phoenix-meadowlark","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMDM2Mzgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/494208?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellaraccident","id":494208,"login":"stellaraccident","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NDIwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/494208?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellaraccident","id":494208,"login":"stellaraccident","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NDIwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellaraccident","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"MLIR modules bound with the Python runtime bindings currently provide incorrect results when returning multiple values (e.g. `return a, b`) and when returning sequences (e.g. `return (a,)` or `return (a, b)`). This is documented in [this colab](https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1n2d2poVTcak4dgKRiNE62qzb8pR5u1az) and below:\r\n\r\n```python\r\nclass PythonTypesModule(tf.Module):\r\n\r\n  @tf.function(input_signature=[])\r\n  def output_tuple_len_0(self):\r\n    return tuple()\r\n\r\n  @tf.function(input_signature=[])\r\n  def output_tuple_len_1(self):\r\n    return (1.,)  # Need to explicitly wrap.\r\n\r\n  @tf.function(input_signature=[])\r\n  def output_tuple_len_2(self):\r\n    return 1., 2.\r\n\r\n  @tf.function(input_signature=[])\r\n  def output_tuple_len_3(self):\r\n    return 1., 2., 3.\r\n```\r\n\r\n```mlir\r\nmodule  {\r\n  func @output_tuple_len_0() attributes {\r\n        iree.module.export,\r\n        iree.reflection = {abi = \"sip\", abiv = 1 : i32, sip = \"I1!R1!\"}\r\n    } {\r\n    return\r\n  }\r\n  func @output_tuple_len_1() -> tensor<f32> attributes {\r\n        iree.module.export,\r\n        iree.reflection = {abi = \"sip\", abiv = 1 : i32, sip = \"I1!R8!S5!k0_0\"}\r\n    } {\r\n    %0 = mhlo.constant dense<1.000000e+00> : tensor<f32>\r\n    return %0 : tensor<f32>\r\n  }\r\n  func @output_tuple_len_2() -> (tensor<f32>, tensor<f32>) attributes {\r\n        iree.module.export,\r\n        iree.reflection = {abi = \"sip\", abiv = 1 : i32, sip = \"I1!R12!S9!k0_0k1_1\"}\r\n    } {\r\n    %0 = mhlo.constant dense<1.000000e+00> : tensor<f32>\r\n    %1 = mhlo.constant dense<2.000000e+00> : tensor<f32>\r\n    return %0, %1 : tensor<f32>, tensor<f32>\r\n  }\r\n  func @output_tuple_len_3() -> (tensor<f32>, tensor<f32>, tensor<f32>) attributes {\r\n        iree.module.export,\r\n        iree.reflection = {abi = \"sip\", abiv = 1 : i32, sip = \"I1!R17!S13!k0_0k1_1k2_2\"}\r\n    } {\r\n    %0 = mhlo.constant dense<1.000000e+00> : tensor<f32>\r\n    %1 = mhlo.constant dense<2.000000e+00> : tensor<f32>\r\n    %2 = mhlo.constant dense<3.000000e+00> : tensor<f32>\r\n    return %0, %1, %2 : tensor<f32>, tensor<f32>, tensor<f32>\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nExpected vs actual results:\r\n\r\n```python\r\nmodule.output_tuple_len_1()\r\nexpected: [array([1.])]\r\nactual:   [None, array([1.])]\r\n\r\nmodule.output_tuple_len_2()\r\nexpected: [array([1.]), array([2.])]\r\nactual:   [None, array([2.])]\r\n\r\nmodule.output_tuple_len_3()\r\nexpected: [array([1.]), array([2.]), array([3.])]\r\nactual:   [None, array([2.]), None, array([3.])]\r\n```\r\n\r\nIREE itself produces the correct values via `iree-run-mlir`:\r\n\r\n```\r\niree/tools/iree-run-mlir \\\r\n  -export-all \\\r\n  -iree-hal-target-backends=dylib-llvm-aot \\\r\n  sequences.mlir\r\n\r\nEXEC @output_tuple_len_1\r\nI iree/iree/tools/utils/vm_util.cc:201] result[0]: Buffer<float32[2]>\r\n1xf32=1\r\n\r\nEXEC @output_tuple_len_2\r\nI iree/iree/tools/utils/vm_util.cc:201] result[0]: Buffer<float32[2]>\r\n1xf32=1\r\nI iree/iree/tools/utils/vm_util.cc:201] result[1]: Buffer<float32[2]>\r\n1xf32=2\r\n\r\nEXEC @output_tuple_len_3\r\nI iree/iree/tools/utils/vm_util.cc:201] result[0]: Buffer<float32[2]>\r\n1xf32=1\r\nI iree/iree/tools/utils/vm_util.cc:201] result[1]: Buffer<float32[2]>\r\n1xf32=2\r\nI iree/iree/tools/utils/vm_util.cc:201] result[2]: Buffer<float32[2]>\r\n1xf32=3\r\n```\r\n\r\nGiven this I would guess that there is some error in how the python bindings are interpreting the SIP or with the SIP itself.","closed_at":"2021-04-09T00:37:05Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40036383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phoenix-meadowlark","id":40036383,"login":"phoenix-meadowlark","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMDM2Mzgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenix-meadowlark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":3,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/5320/comments","created_at":"2021-04-05T21:37:08Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/5320/events","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/5320","id":850707055,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":false,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1553038945,"name":"bug 🐞","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTUzMDM4OTQ1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/labels/bug%20%F0%9F%90%9E"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"22ad75","default":false,"description":"Python wrapping IREE's C API","id":2524353575,"name":"bindings/python","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNTI0MzUzNTc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/labels/bindings/python"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/5320/labels